text ThreeIsland_House2_Text_CantMakeThisSpoonBend {
    "Urrrrrrrrgggghhhh…\n"
    "Kwaaaaah!\p"
    "…It's useless! I can't make this\n"
    "spoon bend with my mind.\p"
    "Maybe I really don't have any\n"
    "psychic powers.$"
}

text ThreeIsland_House2_Text_IAdmireSabrina {
    "You know about a girl GYM LEADER\n"
    "in SAFFRON CITY?\p"
    "She uses PSYCHIC-type POKéMON,\n"
    "right?\p"
    "I admire her, I really do.\p"
    "I've heard that she's one cool\n"
    "customer and beautiful, too.$"
}
